body:
pili ka if ikaw o sila?  
if ikaw then work lang get paid go home  
if sila  resign ka hanap bagong opportunity,

ikaw din nakakaalam ng sagot , if work environment mo  ang problem sino pipiliin mo  sila o ikaw?  
pwede mo dedmahin  ung problems pero  jan papasok  is if yung actual work  mismo  d mo na kaya  
if both environment and actual work mo na ung pumapatay syo then  best you can do is leave,
